{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:AppendixSurreals.CategoricalMordellWeil","@type":"LeanModule","name":"AppendixSurreals.CategoricalMordellWeil","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QBirchSwinnertonDyer","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Subgroup.Ker"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.mem_categoricalSha","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.mem_categoricalSha","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/categorical-mordell-weil.lean#L103-L109","doc":"Membership in `Ш_q`: a global class is in `Ш_q` iff it dies at every\nReeb eigenvalue. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.categoricalSha","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.categoricalSha","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/categorical-mordell-weil.lean#L90-L101","doc":"**The q-Tate–Shafarevich group** `Ш_q(𝓔_q)`: the kernel of the\nlocal–global map on the first monoidal cohomology,\n\n  Ш_q(𝓔_q) := ker ( H¹_⊗(𝐂, E_q) → ∏_{ρ ∈ Spec(ξ_q)} H¹_⊗(𝐂_ρ, E_q) ),\n\nstated for an abelian group `H` (the global `H¹_⊗`), a family of local\ngroups `Hloc ρ` indexed by the Reeb spectrum, and the localisation\nhomomorphisms `loc ρ`.  The kernel of the product map is the\nintersection of the kernels. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.localEulerFactor_zero_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.localEulerFactor_zero_one","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/categorical-mordell-weil.lean#L79-L84","doc":"The Euler factor at a place with vanishing Frobenius eigenvalue and\ntrivial norm reduces to `1/(1 + t²)` — a sanity evaluation of the\ndefinition, nothing more. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.qDeformedLFunction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.qDeformedLFunction","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/categorical-mordell-weil.lean#L71-L77","doc":"**The q-deformed L-function** `L(𝓔_q, s) = ∏_𝔪 localEulerFactor` over a\nfinite set `S` of places `𝔪` of the coordinate ring of Bring's curve,\nwith Frobenius eigenvalue `α 𝔪`, norm `N 𝔪 = q^{f(𝔪)}` and\n`t 𝔪 = N(𝔪)^{−s}`.  The `.md` writes the product over `Spec(R_q)`;\nthe finite truncation is what a computation evaluates. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.localEulerFactor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.localEulerFactor","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/categorical-mordell-weil.lean#L64-L69","doc":"**Local Euler factor** of the q-deformed L-function at a place with\nFrobenius eigenvalue `α` and norm `N`, in the variable `t = N^{−s}`:\n`1 / (1 − α t + N t²)` (`.md` §2, the factor\n`(1 − α_𝓔(𝔪) N(𝔪)^{−s} + N(𝔪)^{1−2s})^{−1}`).  Generic over any\nfield: no `s`-exponentiation is needed once `t` is the variable. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.descartes_rank_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.descartes_rank_zero","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/categorical-mordell-weil.lean#L49-L56","doc":"In the Descartes QOU the categorical Mordell–Weil group of the adjoint\nobject is trivial (`r_q = 0`): `Hom(𝟙, Ad(A))` is a subsingleton by the\nobservability axiom.  Restated from `QOU.descartes_rank_zero` on the\nre-exported name. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.CategoricalMordellWeil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.CategoricalMordellWeil","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/categorical-mordell-weil.lean#L39-L47","doc":"**Categorical Mordell–Weil group** of an object `E` of the monoidal\ncategory `𝐂`: the abelian group of `𝟙`-rational points\n`𝓔_q(𝟙) := Hom_𝐂(𝟙, E)` (`.md` §1).  The same type as\n`QOU.CategoricalMordellWeil`; re-exported here so the content block's\n`lean.ref` resolves to the genuine construction.  The group law is\ninduced by chord–tangent addition on `𝓔_q` transported through the\nfibre functor; only the underlying type is defined. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:categorical-mordell-weil","label":"def:categorical-mordell-weil","md":"quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/categorical-mordell-weil.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}